	"_profile": "Per repo: branch (default), push (fork or branch), cadence (hours), site (the public URL it serves), props (bot when its workflows run Props Bot, else line), ticket_ref (how a commit body cites Meta Trac ticket {N}), links (dependency directories a fresh local worktree borrows from the main checkout; empty when the checks install their own), checks (what CI runs on a PR, in order, from the repo root or dir; bin/check runs them), backlog (open issues filed before the baseline: enabled; mode triage records decisions only, fix also fixes the ready ones; skip_labels are recorded skip \"out of scope\" with no model run; max_open_prs stops backlog fixes while the repo has that many open claude/* PRs; batch is the run's triage limit, new items first).",
